  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recalls Ancestor Blood Sea’s nine true inheritances and names the ancient desolate beast violent blood dragon bat among them, beside Immortal Gu such as blood skull Gu and blood deity.",
      "chapters": [
        407
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_blood_sea_ancestor",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_demonic_blood_skull_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Song Zi Xing holds that violent blood dragon bat as one part of the blood sea inheritance; the dragon bat is not a Gu worm and can be captured and taken away.",
      "chapters": [
        408
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_zi_xing",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Beast ranking runs from hundred beast king through thousand beast king, myriad beast king, and beast emperor, then mutated beasts, then desolate beasts. Above desolate beasts sit ancient desolate beasts and immemorial desolate beasts. Raising an ancient desolate beast in Hu Immortal blessed land is treated as impossible, while ordinary desolate beasts such as hurricane fox or phoenix wings fox might be raised only with luck.",
      "chapters": [
        409
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "beast-ladder",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The broader desolate-beast ladder is covered on desolate beast.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "beast-ladder",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_desolate_beast"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If an ice spike divine ape’s eyeballs were completely frost blue, it would be the ancient desolate beast icefall divine ape, whose battle strength is comparable to a rank seven Gu Immortal. Desolate beasts have the power of a rank six Gu Immortal. Beast enslavement Gu at rank seven can subdue wild beasts through mutated beasts, myriad beast kings, beast emperors, desolate beasts, and ancient desolate beasts.",
      "chapters": [
        701
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-match",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "gu_beast_enslavement_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Each astral wind flying heavenly boar is an ancient desolate beast with rank seven Gu Immortal battle strength. Such beasts are rare in the five regions, yet hundreds appear in black heaven. Gu Immortals note that desolate beasts have low intelligence compared with humans. Nearby dark venomous snakes are desolate beast level, while their king snake is an ancient desolate beast.",
      "chapters": [
        1241
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-in-black-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
